description.content:
You can update the details of a single person. Only the id is mandatory, other fields will be updated if provided. In order to remove a value from the object, you should send it as null.

person
Person Object Model

person.dataList
This is a list of additional person data fields. This object attribute only accepts an array of objects. Objects can only have two properties named fieldToken and value.

[
    {
        "fieldToken": "adres",
        "value": "Selam Sok. 33/4"
    },
    {
        "fieldToken": "evTelefonu",
        "value": "02123456666"
    }
]

person.unitList
This field is the unit list of a person and accepts an array of unit objects, so you can choose to add historical data or only the active unit. If the field default is true that means it will be the default unit throughout the system. Items will be removed if not included that has already been sent while creating. So the given array will be the final list of units.

[
    {
        "startDate": "2020-08-13",
        "endDate": "2020-08-14",
        "employmentType": "fulltime",
        "managerId": null,
        "default": true,
